  21 subjects taking a 600 trial flankers task with varying luminance.  Task included in Matlab programming language.   Data collected ~2015 at the Mind Research Network via the Cognitive Rhythms and Computation Lab, University of New Mexico.   WRT triggers: check if these are correct, or if they should be 255-trigger (as EGI is wont to do).   - James F Cavanagh & Mark Lavelle, 04/25/2024